---
source: crates/krishiv-optimizer/tests/it/as_of.rs
expression: SELECT * FROM t ASOF JOIN u MATCH_CONDITION (t.a >= u.a) ON t.b = u.d WHERE t.c > 3 AND rand() > 0.5
---
Filter (rand() > 0.5D)
+- AsOfJoin Inner, a#0 >= a#3, (b#1 == d#4)
   :- Filter (c#2 > 3L)
   :  +- Scan spark_catalog.default.t [a#0, b#1, c#2]
   +- Scan spark_catalog.default.u [a#3, d#4]
